## ✅ **KEY IMPROVEMENTS IN THIS SCHEMA**

### **1. Language Table ✨**
```
✅ Dynamic language management
✅ Easy to add new languages (Russian, etc.)
✅ Language metadata (flag, direction, name)
✅ Enable/disable languages
✅ RTL support ready
```

### **2. Program Templates ✨**
```
✅ Reusable templates for categories
✅ Pre-configured block structures
✅ Usage tracking
✅ Visibility control (global/team/personal)
```

### **3. Programs Listing Block Support ✨**
```
✅ Display child programs as cards
✅ Auto-fetch or manual selection
✅ Flexible layout options
✅ Complete configuration in JSON
```

### **4. Enhanced Tracking**
```
✅ viewCount on programs/posts
✅ Activity logs for audit trail
✅ Usage count on templates
✅ Last login tracking
```

### **5. Better Indexing**
```
✅ All foreign keys indexed
✅ Search fields indexed (slug, email, etc.)
✅ Filter fields indexed (published, isActive, etc.)
✅ Optimized for queries
```

### **6. Flexible & Future-Proof**
```
✅ JSON blocks (add any block type)
✅ Version control (page/program versions)
✅ Slug aliases (SEO redirects)
✅ Metadata fields (alt, caption, etc.)
```

